# Shipping live files

App owns I/O + app `config/` tuneables. Label Page Threshold workbook lives under `database/shipping-label-generator/`. ShipStation secrets are warehouse-shared.

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `Shipping Label Generator/DTF Des Files/` | Input desfiles |
| `Shipping Label Generator/DTF Des Files - Processed/` | Archived inputs |
| `Shipping Label Generator/config/shipping_config.yaml` | Tuneables (`shared.paths.shipping_yaml_path`) |
| `database/shipping-label-generator/Configuration Workbook.xlsx` | Label Page Threshold |
| `config/ShipStation/.env` | Only ShipStation secrets file (warehouse-wide) |
| `Output/Shipping Label Generator/` | Labels, batch PDFs, `Reports/` (label-report) |
| `Logs/Shipping Label Generator/` | Run logs + `Error and Failures/` |
